ars Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006204\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007660\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006205\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Ballerina\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Taking place during the events of John Wick: Chapter 3 – Parabellum, the film follows Eve Macarro (Ana de Armas) who is beginning her training in the assassin traditions of the Ruska Roma.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Taking place during the events of John Wick: Chapter 3 – Parabellum, the film follows Eve Macarro (Ana de Armas) who is beginning her training in the assassin traditions \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-06\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":124,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EcsDV0rWEFc\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001278\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001397\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002175\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004517\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005252\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005257\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007297\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008887\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011420\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011421\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000132\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000136\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000026\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"f23b3bec-30b4-4b5f-97e9-a0d2427493c7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006205\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007661\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Lionsgate\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006206\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"How to Train Your Dragon\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A live-action remake of the beloved animation that explores the bond between a Viking boy and his dragon, a friendship that flies in the face of centuries of tradition. Together, they confront an ancient threat that endangers both species. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"On the rugged isle of Berk, where Vikings and dragons have been bitter enemies for generations, Hiccup (Mason Thames; The Black Phone, For All Mankind) stands apart.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild threat, scary scenes, violence, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CS_TVzQpNlg\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000269\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003403\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004805\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006974\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006978\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007232\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008693\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011422\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011423\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011424\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011425\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011426\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011427\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"4360\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\",\"0000000028\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5970f2a4-78f6-48eb-a600-f37fc295f441\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006206\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007662\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006110\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"F1® The Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career. Thirty years later, he’s a nomadic racer-for-hire when he’s approached by his former teammate Ruben Cervantes (Javier Bardem), owner of a struggling FORMULA 1 team that is on the verge of collapse. Ruben convinces Sonny to come back to FORMULA 1 for one last shot at saving the team and being the best in the world. He’ll drive alongside Joshua Pearce (Damson Idris), the team's hotshot rookie intent on setting his own pace. But as the engines roar, Sonny’s past catches up with him and he finds that in FORMULA 1, your teammate is your fiercest competition—and the road to redemption is not something you can travel alone.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":156,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TZGY2CWPXeU\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000166\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000167\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001693\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002986\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003190\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003191\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008544\",\"ro